WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.500
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.770 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.150 --> 01:43.690
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.720 --> 01:45.690
[Episode 4]

5
01:46.870 --> 01:48.509
47 years ago,

6
01:49.229 --> 01:51.590
the Great Shi Dynasty wiped out Liluo.

7
01:51.710 --> 01:53.570
Their crimes were unforgivable.

8
01:54.120 --> 01:56.039
Tianmoluo took root here

9
01:56.120 --> 01:58.840
by the will of the God Kelu.

10
01:59.310 --> 02:02.370
It will feed on the lifeblood of children from Great Shi

11
02:02.480 --> 02:05.040
to bear the fruit of vengeance.

12
02:15.080 --> 02:16.120
Wen Nansheng.

13
02:16.430 --> 02:17.470
I get it now.

14
02:17.680 --> 02:19.680
The killer first murdered Master Sun,

15
02:19.680 --> 02:21.710
then killed Wen Nansheng.

16
02:21.710 --> 02:22.710
He took the lower half of

17
02:22.710 --> 02:23.960
Wen Nansheng's body

18
02:24.120 --> 02:25.910
and mixed it with the upper half

19
02:25.910 --> 02:27.190
of Master Sun's.

20
02:27.470 --> 02:29.120
Master Sun's lower body

21
02:29.680 --> 02:31.400
and Wen Nansheng's upper body

22
02:31.840 --> 02:32.680
fit together perfectly

23
02:32.680 --> 02:34.079
to make one whole corpse.

24
02:34.470 --> 02:36.150
Corpses,

25
02:36.360 --> 02:37.680
puppets—

26
02:38.360 --> 02:39.310
they're nothing but

27
02:39.310 --> 02:41.400
lifeless things.

28
02:41.960 --> 02:43.840
The only fate waiting for them

29
02:44.120 --> 02:45.590
is decay.

30
02:46.950 --> 02:48.829
I hate decay.

31
02:48.900 --> 02:50.950
I hate death.

32
02:52.000 --> 02:54.350
Look at God Kelu.

33
02:54.520 --> 02:55.870
Never rots,

34
02:56.030 --> 02:57.490
never dies.

35
02:57.590 --> 02:59.079
Isn't that wonderful?

36
03:00.840 --> 03:02.630
You drain blood to make cursed incense, harm young girls,

37
03:02.630 --> 03:03.630
kidnap children…

38
03:03.840 --> 03:04.910
and you killed Wen Nansheng

39
03:04.910 --> 03:06.030
and Master Sun.

40
03:06.150 --> 03:07.680
Why? Why did you do all this?

41
03:10.120 --> 03:12.810
You're all going to die anyway.

42
03:13.080 --> 03:14.870
Might as well tell you.

43
03:16.470 --> 03:19.400
Kelu, the great god of the ancient Liluo Sect,

44
03:19.910 --> 03:22.630
rules over all growth and life.

45
03:23.680 --> 03:25.890
When he takes the form of Tianmoluo,

46
03:26.310 --> 03:28.910
he can bear the fruit of immortality.

47
03:30.190 --> 03:33.860
Eat it, and you stay young forever,

48
03:33.890 --> 03:35.740
never aging, never dying.

49
03:36.960 --> 03:40.030
For the fruit to ripen fully,

50
03:40.870 --> 03:43.030
I need the pure yang energy

51
03:43.030 --> 03:44.920
of 36 children

52
03:45.079 --> 03:49.480
to nourish Tianmoluo's dark yin body.

53
03:52.910 --> 03:54.520
You kidnapped all those children

54
03:54.520 --> 03:56.320
just to feed this evil creature?

55
03:56.910 --> 03:57.910
I understand now.

56
03:57.960 --> 03:59.470
Young boys possess pure yang essence.

57
03:59.470 --> 04:01.520
Between the ages of 6 and 13,

58
04:01.680 --> 04:02.840
as their kidney energy awakens,

59
04:02.840 --> 04:04.080
they lose their baby teeth and grow new ones.

60
04:04.080 --> 04:04.840
Their inner vital energy

61
04:04.840 --> 04:06.150
is at its peak.

62
04:06.630 --> 04:08.030
No wonder all the kidnapped kids

63
04:08.030 --> 04:09.560
were the ones losing their teeth.

64
04:09.560 --> 04:10.710
You keep chanting

65
04:10.710 --> 04:12.280
"God Kelu is above us all."

66
04:12.280 --> 04:13.470
But in my eyes,

67
04:14.080 --> 04:15.120
all this talk

68
04:15.560 --> 04:17.290
just means you're afraid to die

69
04:17.450 --> 04:19.480
and crave immortality.

70
04:22.070 --> 04:23.560
Am I wrong,

71
04:24.160 --> 04:25.390
Master Coroner Wen?

72
04:33.830 --> 04:34.720
Li Qingyang.

73
04:34.920 --> 04:36.159
That's not Wen Nansheng.

74
04:36.159 --> 04:37.570
He's just a human puppet.

75
04:37.830 --> 04:39.560
Lady Fragrance was the puppet.

76
04:39.720 --> 04:42.830
And Wen Nansheng never died at all.

77
04:44.070 --> 04:45.630
He knew your autopsy skills were unmatched,

78
04:45.630 --> 04:47.750
Master Coroner Bai.

79
04:48.070 --> 04:48.950
So

80
04:50.040 --> 04:50.830
he cut off the legs of

81
04:50.830 --> 04:52.480
someone with rheumatism

82
04:52.680 --> 04:53.750
to throw us off.

83
04:54.240 --> 04:55.630
He wanted

84
04:55.830 --> 04:57.920
to fake Wen Nansheng's death.

85
04:58.920 --> 05:00.430
Look at how swollen the legs are—

86
05:00.430 --> 05:01.720
that's rheumatism,

87
05:01.720 --> 05:04.070
from years of working in damp, dark places.

88
05:04.070 --> 05:06.330
And the jade pendant left on the clothes…

89
05:06.360 --> 05:08.090
it must belong to Wen Nansheng.

90
05:08.560 --> 05:09.360
Earlier,

91
05:10.070 --> 05:11.270
he was speaking to us

92
05:11.270 --> 05:12.530
using ventriloquism.

93
05:12.830 --> 05:13.560
Pretending to be

94
05:13.560 --> 05:15.000
a mindless human puppet—

95
05:15.240 --> 05:16.830
it was all just an illusion.

96
05:17.240 --> 05:18.160
Wen Nansheng.

97
05:18.720 --> 05:20.480
Why did you kill Master Sun?

98
05:24.720 --> 05:26.370
Dougu County isn't big,

99
05:26.510 --> 05:27.920
but searching house by house

100
05:27.920 --> 05:29.450
for kids losing their teeth

101
05:29.630 --> 05:31.270
would take too long.

102
05:31.720 --> 05:33.950
Chunfeng Hall treats people

103
05:33.950 --> 05:35.560
with toothaches all the time.

104
05:35.560 --> 05:36.600
So I figure

105
05:37.070 --> 05:38.510
you got the list

106
05:38.510 --> 05:40.640
of teething children from Master Sun.

107
05:40.750 --> 05:41.630
That's why

108
05:41.870 --> 05:43.390
you killed Master Sun—

109
05:43.870 --> 05:45.830
to silence him.

110
05:46.360 --> 05:48.070
But if Master Sun had kept quiet,

111
05:48.070 --> 05:49.830
nothing would have been exposed.

112
05:49.830 --> 05:50.920
Why risk everything

113
05:50.920 --> 05:52.120
by killing Master Sun

114
05:52.240 --> 05:53.630
and drawing our investigation?

115
05:53.630 --> 05:55.950
Children in the county have been going missing one after another.

116
05:55.950 --> 05:57.480
Right at this time,

117
05:57.830 --> 05:59.159
Master Sun's daughter,

118
05:59.159 --> 06:00.240
Yuyao, who just lost her baby teeth,

119
06:00.240 --> 06:01.390
also disappeared.

120
06:01.830 --> 06:03.390
Master Sun didn't know

121
06:03.510 --> 06:04.600
that Yuyao was actually

122
06:04.600 --> 06:05.950
kidnapped by bandits.

123
06:05.950 --> 06:09.160
He thought Wen Nansheng was too greedy

124
06:09.560 --> 06:11.630
and killed his daughter.

125
06:11.870 --> 06:13.400
You were partners in crime.

126
06:13.480 --> 06:15.140
Then you turned on each other.

127
06:15.270 --> 06:16.160
Wen Nansheng…

128
06:16.310 --> 06:18.680
you killed Lady Fragrance too, didn't you?

129
06:18.680 --> 06:19.480
To steal

130
06:19.480 --> 06:21.340
the Dead Bone Spice from her shop.

131
06:37.120 --> 06:39.630
That woman locked the door

132
06:40.090 --> 06:42.159
thinking I couldn't get in.

133
06:42.240 --> 06:44.040
But I got in anyway…

134
06:45.840 --> 06:48.040
and killed her with one stab.

135
06:53.070 --> 06:53.870
And then

136
06:55.700 --> 06:59.200
her cowardly brother

137
06:59.240 --> 07:00.830
just went mad.

138
07:06.720 --> 07:08.070
How did you get inside?

139
07:08.070 --> 07:09.070
Seize him first.

140
07:09.360 --> 07:10.870
Take him back. Interrogate slowly.

141
07:10.870 --> 07:11.680
Stop!

142
07:17.070 --> 07:18.190
Come any closer,

143
07:18.270 --> 07:19.920
and I'll kill Yuyao.

144
07:24.320 --> 07:27.310
The Divine Constable Bureau,

145
07:27.720 --> 07:30.160
solving cases by using a little girl as bait?

146
07:30.160 --> 07:33.120
What kind of heroes are you?

147
07:34.120 --> 07:35.040
Wen Nansheng,

148
07:37.070 --> 07:38.830
Tell me—who

149
07:38.920 --> 07:40.630
put you up to all this?

150
07:40.630 --> 07:42.600
And who taught you

151
07:43.070 --> 07:45.010
the puppetry to control puppet doll?

152
07:45.010 --> 07:46.150
Want to know?

153
07:47.710 --> 07:49.890
Ask me in your next life.

154
08:05.890 --> 08:06.770
What's heck?

155
08:09.510 --> 08:10.480
What's heck?

156
08:10.480 --> 08:12.040
My little Hua Erbao.

157
08:12.120 --> 08:13.570
You've done well.

158
08:15.950 --> 08:16.750
What,

159
08:17.120 --> 08:18.830
only you get to use tricks and illusions?

160
08:18.830 --> 08:20.240
I can't play along too?

161
08:22.950 --> 08:24.830
So you never actually used Yuyao as bait.

162
08:24.830 --> 08:26.040
Lord Constable Ghost,

163
08:26.040 --> 08:28.680
Yuyao is safe and sound

164
08:28.680 --> 08:30.340
at Mrs. Hua's house right now.

165
08:30.850 --> 08:33.400
You have gone too far!

166
09:22.670 --> 09:23.670
My lords.

167
09:24.480 --> 09:25.270
These puppet dolls,

168
09:25.270 --> 09:26.840
although their moves are marvelous,

169
09:26.840 --> 09:28.440
are just mechanisms after all.

170
09:28.440 --> 09:29.500
Perhaps,

171
09:30.120 --> 09:31.720
if we hold on for a few more moves,

172
09:31.720 --> 09:33.510
their moves will repeat.

173
09:34.480 --> 09:35.270
A few moves?

174
09:36.840 --> 09:38.480
You'll find out once you fight.

175
09:38.480 --> 09:39.150
You!

176
10:23.490 --> 10:24.510
Trying to run?

177
10:51.440 --> 10:52.330
Now you know

178
10:52.360 --> 10:54.130
why I killed the coroner.

179
10:56.660 --> 10:59.050
-I want his face. -How was the scent theft

180
10:59.240 --> 11:01.100
in the sealed chamber pulled off?

181
11:01.150 --> 11:03.910
The truth’s out now, isn’t it?

182
11:04.030 --> 11:05.270
Others couldn't get in.

183
11:05.270 --> 11:06.320
He is a dwarf,

184
11:06.440 --> 11:08.570
so he could crawl through the dog hole.

185
11:14.870 --> 11:16.230
The Divine Constable Bureau searched all over Tianhuang City

186
11:16.230 --> 11:17.630
for a three-foot puppet.

187
11:17.630 --> 11:18.600
But in fact,

188
11:18.750 --> 11:19.770
there is no such thing as

189
11:19.770 --> 11:20.970
a three-foot puppet.

190
11:21.090 --> 11:22.310
From beginning to end,

191
11:22.310 --> 11:24.200
there was only you, a dwarf.

192
11:24.200 --> 11:25.840
This is called shrinking a dragon into inches,

193
11:25.840 --> 11:27.330
an innate immortal body.

194
11:27.360 --> 11:28.660
So that's how it is.

195
11:29.270 --> 11:30.200
No wonder he harmed

196
11:30.200 --> 11:31.930
so many girls in Tianhuang City

197
11:32.000 --> 11:33.000
but was never brought to justice.

198
11:33.000 --> 11:35.440
As long as the dwarf's main body wasn't found,

199
11:35.440 --> 11:37.080
he just needed to use other corpses

200
11:37.080 --> 11:38.360
to make puppet doll

201
11:38.440 --> 11:39.550
as a smokescreen.

202
11:41.530 --> 11:42.960
Great God of Kelu,

203
11:42.990 --> 11:44.720
please show your miracle.

204
11:44.720 --> 11:45.440
Get rid of

205
11:45.440 --> 11:46.870
these three heretics who dared disturb

206
11:46.870 --> 11:48.080
your slumber.

207
11:48.120 --> 11:49.630
So-called God Kelu…

208
11:50.240 --> 11:51.000
You've told so many lies

209
11:51.000 --> 11:52.800
you even believe them yourself.

210
12:02.260 --> 12:04.370
God Kelu has manifested!

211
12:25.750 --> 12:27.750
Meng Rui, Heaven-Measuring Ruler.

212
12:36.750 --> 12:39.550
Arrogant Dragon Thousand-Mechanism Formation!

213
13:19.120 --> 13:20.210
Mr. Meng.

214
14:07.630 --> 14:08.440
Li Qingyang.

215
14:08.440 --> 14:09.200
Li Si.

216
14:10.550 --> 14:11.390
I'm fine.

217
14:20.000 --> 14:20.960
Wen Nansheng!

218
14:21.190 --> 14:23.330
-Surrender now! -My flowers!

219
14:27.200 --> 14:27.960
Great…

220
14:27.960 --> 14:30.520
God Kelu, Tianmoluo…

221
14:30.750 --> 14:31.910
destroyed by

222
14:31.910 --> 14:33.090
your hands…

223
14:33.200 --> 14:35.400
Do you not fear divine retribution?

224
14:37.120 --> 14:39.340
My Tianmoluo…

225
14:41.360 --> 14:43.900
God Kelu…

226
14:44.000 --> 14:46.790
help me.

227
15:01.870 --> 15:04.240
Those who do evil will destroy themselves.

228
15:04.240 --> 15:05.030
Ms. Bai.

229
15:05.670 --> 15:06.480
Mr. Meng

230
15:06.960 --> 15:08.420
hurry and save the people.

231
15:16.130 --> 15:18.680
[Dougu County Office]

232
15:16.750 --> 15:18.360
The children are all dead!

233
15:18.910 --> 15:19.870
My lord, my lord!

234
15:19.160 --> 15:25.400
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

235
15:19.870 --> 15:21.910
Our child can't die for nothing!

236
15:21.910 --> 15:22.630
My lord!

237
15:22.670 --> 15:23.790
My lord!

238
15:24.550 --> 15:25.360
My lord!

239
15:25.720 --> 15:28.030
I'm Cuicui's father!

240
15:28.120 --> 15:29.240
This is… Cuicui!

241
15:29.040 --> 15:30.780
[Enter the County Office to Examine Oneself]

242
15:29.320 --> 15:30.150
My daughter is Cuicui!

243
15:30.150 --> 15:31.240
My lord, my lord!

244
15:31.240 --> 15:33.150
I'm Youyou's mother! My lord!

245
15:34.720 --> 15:36.270
Give us justice!

246
15:35.010 --> 15:36.700
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

247
15:41.480 --> 15:42.550
I, Li, am humble.

248
15:42.570 --> 15:44.450
Today I ask Mr. Du

249
15:44.480 --> 15:45.610
to bear witness.

250
15:46.270 --> 15:48.960
Here is five thousand taels of silver.

251
15:49.080 --> 15:50.910
One hundred taels as compensation for each family.

252
15:49.140 --> 15:49.570
[Great Shi Treasure Notes]

253
15:50.910 --> 15:51.910
That's too much…

254
15:52.550 --> 15:54.120
There were only about thirty children.

255
15:54.120 --> 15:55.030
The rest

256
15:55.150 --> 15:57.680
I shall donate entirely to the county office.

257
15:58.790 --> 15:59.600
Good.

258
16:00.150 --> 16:00.790
Is that acceptable?

259
16:00.790 --> 16:01.150
Yes.

260
16:01.150 --> 16:02.120
Then why don't you say it?

261
16:02.120 --> 16:03.120
Good, good, good.

262
16:04.510 --> 16:06.310
Let them come collect the money.

263
16:07.320 --> 16:08.510
Everyone may approach.

264
16:08.510 --> 16:09.960
Stop! Do not enter!

265
16:10.120 --> 16:11.480
Don't rush! Don't fight!

266
16:11.480 --> 16:12.960
Who dares disrupt the court?

267
16:12.960 --> 16:14.490
You—give it to me first!

268
16:14.600 --> 16:15.200
Let go!

269
16:15.200 --> 16:16.200
Don't fight!

270
16:17.910 --> 16:18.720
Give it to me! Give it to me!

271
16:18.720 --> 16:19.670
Everyone gets their share.

272
16:19.670 --> 16:20.480
Out of my way!

273
16:22.000 --> 16:22.750
I was first!

274
16:22.750 --> 16:23.600
Don't fight!

275
16:23.720 --> 16:25.000
Protect me!

276
16:25.000 --> 16:25.870
My lord!

277
16:25.910 --> 16:26.960
My lord! My lord!

278
16:26.960 --> 16:27.670
No fighting!

279
16:27.670 --> 16:29.130
No fighting! No fighting!

280
16:30.120 --> 16:31.910
No fighting!

281
16:32.360 --> 16:33.440
Hold it tight!

282
16:33.870 --> 16:35.790
Hurry and register them!

283
16:36.390 --> 16:37.910
No one's registered yet!

284
16:37.940 --> 16:38.720
Stop standing around! Move!

285
16:38.720 --> 16:39.510
You unruly people!

286
16:39.510 --> 16:40.360
Don't leave!

287
16:40.440 --> 16:41.410
Don't leave!

288
16:41.510 --> 16:43.430
Give back my silver!

289
16:43.750 --> 16:45.270
You like eating chicken, don't you?

290
16:45.270 --> 16:46.550
Eat all you want this time.

291
16:46.550 --> 16:47.600
Write it all down!

292
16:47.600 --> 16:48.390
Write it down!

293
16:48.390 --> 16:49.650
Every last one of them!

294
16:58.870 --> 17:01.000
Really? A hundred taels for real?

295
17:02.600 --> 17:04.069
So much money!

296
17:06.720 --> 17:08.200
Father! Mother!

297
17:08.880 --> 17:09.750
I'm home!

298
17:11.790 --> 17:13.349
Mother!

299
17:13.349 --> 17:14.680
Father!

300
17:14.680 --> 17:15.790
Mother!

301
17:15.790 --> 17:16.589
Youyou!

302
17:16.640 --> 17:17.670
Mother!

303
17:17.720 --> 17:21.349
Father, my feet hurt.

304
17:21.400 --> 17:23.550
Father, Mother!

305
17:23.210 --> 17:25.180
[Noble Righteousness] [Law Enforced Unwaveringly]

306
17:24.000 --> 17:26.240
Mother, I'm hungry.

307
17:28.109 --> 17:30.070
-Father! Father! -Mother.

308
17:30.160 --> 17:32.110
I'm scared.

309
17:32.270 --> 17:33.180
-Father. -Mother.

310
17:33.180 --> 17:34.640
Father!

311
17:34.790 --> 17:37.070
Father! Father!

312
17:38.270 --> 17:39.110
Sir,

313
17:39.590 --> 17:41.000
didn't the children all die?

314
17:41.000 --> 17:42.970
Mother, I'm so scared.

315
17:43.270 --> 17:45.000
Alright, let's go. Let's go. Let's go.

316
17:45.000 --> 17:45.920
Hurry home.

317
17:46.440 --> 17:47.240
Strange…

318
17:47.400 --> 17:48.110
These parents

319
17:48.110 --> 17:49.920
were weeping bitterly just now.

320
17:49.960 --> 17:51.920
Why have they suddenly changed faces?

321
17:51.920 --> 17:52.680
It's almost as if

322
17:52.680 --> 17:54.210
they were putting on an act.

323
17:55.070 --> 17:56.680
Could it be the children weren't really taken?

324
17:56.680 --> 17:57.680
Or…

325
17:57.790 --> 17:58.960
the ones taken

326
17:58.960 --> 18:00.820
weren't even their own children?

327
18:03.030 --> 18:03.830
Yuyao,

328
18:04.480 --> 18:05.960
can you point out to me

329
18:06.350 --> 18:07.480
which one among them

330
18:07.750 --> 18:09.200
is Cuicui's father?

331
18:11.720 --> 18:13.650
Sesame cakes! Fresh sesame cakes!

332
18:14.110 --> 18:15.120
Sesame cakes!

333
18:15.270 --> 18:16.610
Sesame cakes!

334
18:16.720 --> 18:19.030
Two copper each!

335
18:21.270 --> 18:22.110
Let's go.

336
18:24.000 --> 18:25.480
Young master, come buy a cake!

337
18:25.480 --> 18:26.480
Two copper each!

338
18:32.470 --> 18:33.270
Mister,

339
18:33.790 --> 18:34.510
answer just one question,

340
18:34.510 --> 18:36.110
and this silver ingot is yours.

341
