[Righteous Dougu County Magistrate]

685
33:21.070 --> 33:22.070
Bring up the rear!

686
33:27.240 --> 33:28.500
Good morning, Ms. Bai.

687
33:30.480 --> 33:31.480
Where is Mr. Meng?

688
33:32.550 --> 33:33.680
He's watching me,

689
33:33.680 --> 33:35.080
not the other way around.

690
33:35.480 --> 33:36.830
Report!

691
33:38.510 --> 33:39.270
Divine Constable!

692
33:39.270 --> 33:40.240
The prisoner Du Yi'an…

693
33:40.240 --> 33:41.240
he's dead in his cell.

694
33:41.240 --> 33:42.000
What?

695
33:42.070 --> 33:42.790
How did he die?

696
33:42.790 --> 33:45.070
It looks like he was scared to death.

697
33:47.240 --> 33:48.400
A man like him

698
33:48.680 --> 33:49.680
is better dead.

699
33:51.480 --> 33:52.270
Clean.

700
34:07.350 --> 34:08.679
Truly cleaner that way.

701
34:12.440 --> 34:13.400
We should leave.

702
34:14.000 --> 34:14.800
Let's go.

703
34:24.770 --> 34:27.460
[Star-Gathering Pavilion Branch]

704
35:08.190 --> 35:09.150
Everything checks out.

705
35:08.430 --> 35:09.660
[Great Shi's border troops win successive battles, yet lack grain supplies.]

706
35:09.190 --> 35:10.030
News from the border.

707
35:09.690 --> 35:10.660
[A standoff with Northern Kun is set. Both sides are trapped in a stalemate.]

708
35:10.030 --> 35:11.440
match those from Huangquanji.

709
35:10.690 --> 35:11.070
[Underworld Market]

710
35:11.440 --> 35:13.070
The Great Shi border troops have won successive battles,

711
35:13.070 --> 35:14.280
but they lack grain and supplies.

712
35:14.280 --> 35:15.800
A stalemate with the Northern Kun has formed.

713
35:15.800 --> 35:17.670
Neither side can back down.

714
35:20.960 --> 35:22.150
My lords,

715
35:22.760 --> 35:24.760
we've been traveling for half a day.

716
35:24.880 --> 35:26.230
Our throats are dry.

717
35:26.590 --> 35:29.150
Why don't we find a place to rest?

718
35:29.440 --> 35:30.840
The nearest post station

719
35:30.880 --> 35:32.840
is still 5 miles away.

720
35:33.280 --> 35:34.540
Lord Constable Ghost,

721
35:36.590 --> 35:38.030
who says only post stations

722
35:38.030 --> 35:39.430
exist on official roads?

723
35:57.070 --> 35:59.670
Alright, alright, alright.

724
36:00.590 --> 36:02.850
This is also a Star-Gathering Pavilion.

725
36:03.670 --> 36:04.480
Honestly,

726
36:04.800 --> 36:06.110
this is just

727
36:06.110 --> 36:07.230
a small branch.

728
36:10.670 --> 36:11.670
To be frank,

729
36:11.880 --> 36:14.280
I do have selfish motives.

730
36:15.280 --> 36:16.630
Dare I say,

731
36:17.150 --> 36:18.440
countless nobles and elites

732
36:18.440 --> 36:20.900
have entered the Star-Gathering Pavilion.

733
36:21.000 --> 36:23.070
If we can have the honor of

734
36:23.150 --> 36:24.230
Lord Constable Frost

735
36:24.230 --> 36:25.880
and Lord Constable Ghost's presence,

736
36:25.880 --> 36:28.400
our fame will flourish,

737
36:28.840 --> 36:30.500
and our halls will be blessed.

738
36:32.280 --> 36:33.480
A rest wouldn't hurt.

739
36:37.670 --> 36:38.930
Lord Constable Frost,

740
36:39.190 --> 36:40.230
you should know

741
36:40.440 --> 36:41.440
these

742
36:41.740 --> 36:43.250
cannot hold me.

743
36:43.440 --> 36:44.150
We've tried everything these days.

744
36:44.150 --> 36:45.590
Young Master Qingyang's

745
36:46.330 --> 36:48.610
power is beyond us.

746
36:48.640 --> 36:50.300
We truly cannot restrain him.

747
36:50.670 --> 36:52.280
Does Mr. Meng

748
36:52.280 --> 36:53.760
have another plan?

749
36:54.280 --> 36:55.070
How about…

750
36:55.670 --> 36:57.070
we cut his tendons?

751
36:57.070 --> 36:58.000
No need.

752
36:59.570 --> 37:01.740
Please, take a seat, both of you.

753
37:07.760 --> 37:09.230
Master, long time no see.

754
37:09.360 --> 37:10.150
I've prepared fine wine

755
37:10.150 --> 37:11.740
and food for the lords.

756
37:12.190 --> 37:13.070
Hurry up.

757
37:16.480 --> 37:17.630
My lords,

758
37:17.880 --> 37:18.670
would you say

759
37:19.230 --> 37:20.670
my Star-Gathering Pavilion

760
37:20.670 --> 37:21.880
is the finest restaurant

761
37:21.880 --> 37:24.070
in the Great Shi Dynasty?

762
37:31.550 --> 37:32.360
Alright…

763
37:33.000 --> 37:34.000
the dishes

764
37:34.190 --> 37:35.740
are a bit simple.

765
37:35.960 --> 37:38.400
I hope you'll forgive me.

766
37:46.480 --> 37:47.440
I don't drink.

767
37:58.030 --> 37:58.840
Let's eat.

768
38:01.280 --> 38:03.070
Mr. Meng, please.

769
38:11.440 --> 38:13.280
Ms. Bai, taste some.

770
38:14.800 --> 38:16.590
Don't worry—

771
38:16.760 --> 38:17.880
this won't be charged

772
38:17.880 --> 38:19.670
to the Divine Constable Bureau's travel expenses.

773
38:19.670 --> 38:20.800
It's my treat.

774
38:20.880 --> 38:23.190
Please help yourselves.

775
38:24.000 --> 38:26.190
Master Li is certainly casual.

776
38:30.280 --> 38:31.960
Ms. Bai, please.

777
38:45.280 --> 38:46.190
Ms. Bai,

778
38:46.880 --> 38:48.070
you don't think

779
38:48.360 --> 38:49.670
I poisoned the food,

780
38:50.230 --> 38:51.630
do you?

781
38:59.440 --> 39:00.360
Ms. Bai,

782
39:00.670 --> 39:02.270
you're a master of medicine.

783
39:02.360 --> 39:03.760
Who would dare

784
39:03.760 --> 39:04.760
poison your meal?

785
39:06.400 --> 39:07.670
I dare not poison mine.

786
39:07.880 --> 39:09.230
But others might.

787
39:12.800 --> 39:14.130
That's not what I meant.

788
39:15.800 --> 39:17.230
Rest assured, my lords.

789
39:17.230 --> 39:17.840
Our master

790
39:17.840 --> 39:19.070
always teaches us

791
39:19.070 --> 39:20.760
the Star-Gathering Pavilion runs a proper business.

792
39:20.760 --> 39:22.840
We obey the law and act with integrity.

793
39:22.840 --> 39:24.030
We never cheat

794
39:24.030 --> 39:25.400
or harm others.

795
39:26.230 --> 39:27.360
Even if our master

796
39:27.360 --> 39:29.150
is in cuffs before you,

797
39:30.120 --> 39:31.510
if he truly did

798
39:31.510 --> 39:32.670
something evil,

799
39:32.670 --> 39:33.230
we would never side with him.

800
39:33.230 --> 39:34.440
Well said!

801
39:34.440 --> 39:35.150
Good!

802
39:36.460 --> 39:37.520
Well said!

803
39:37.590 --> 39:38.800
Very well said!

804
39:39.750 --> 39:41.410
Splendidly said!

805
39:43.990 --> 39:45.230
Though it's a branch,

806
39:45.280 --> 39:47.410
it has the spirit of the main Pavilion.

807
39:47.880 --> 39:48.670
Let's eat.

808
39:53.840 --> 39:54.900
Where is everyone?

809
39:55.880 --> 39:57.280
Why are you just standing there?

810
39:57.280 --> 39:58.440
Serve them!

811
39:58.460 --> 39:59.540
Yes! Yes!

812
39:59.840 --> 40:00.970
Xiaohong, Xiaoyue,

813
40:01.670 --> 40:02.480
come here!

814
40:24.770 --> 40:25.730
My lords,

815
40:25.980 --> 40:28.490
now the atmosphere is right.

816
40:32.030 --> 40:32.800
Go! Go! Go!

817
40:32.800 --> 40:33.480
Hurry!

818
40:34.480 --> 40:35.280
Hurry up.

819
40:36.150 --> 40:36.960
Li Si!

820
40:37.480 --> 40:38.960
What are you really up to?

821
40:39.400 --> 40:40.800
Let me be clear:

822
40:40.800 --> 40:41.630
there is

823
40:41.840 --> 40:43.440
no way you're being set free.

824
40:47.670 --> 40:48.670
My lords,

825
40:49.070 --> 40:50.190
don't be angry.

826
40:51.590 --> 40:52.400
I truly

827
40:53.630 --> 40:55.000
have one question

828
40:55.400 --> 40:56.760
to ask the both of you.

829
41:02.170 --> 41:05.920
Does the Divine Constable Bureau have any openings?

830
41:08.230 --> 41:10.290
Back to the Divine Constable Bureau.

831
41:11.420 --> 41:12.950
You want to join the Divine Constable Bureau?

832
41:12.950 --> 41:13.830
In your dreams.

833
41:15.800 --> 41:16.820
Where's the owner?

834
41:16.820 --> 41:19.210
[Bright Breeze and Clear Moon]

835
41:17.230 --> 41:18.150
Sir.

836
41:18.190 --> 41:19.670
We're taking over this place tonight.

837
41:19.670 --> 41:21.770
No one else stays here.

838
41:21.880 --> 41:23.510
-We have guests in the upper room. -Let’s have dinner first.

839
41:23.510 --> 41:24.230
Insolence!

840
41:25.230 --> 41:26.630
Do you know who this is?

841
41:26.840 --> 41:28.240
This is Young Master Wen.

842
41:44.260 --> 41:45.130
Leave!

843
41:49.510 --> 41:50.400
All of you, out!

844
41:51.550 --> 41:52.280
Out! Out! Out!

845
41:52.280 --> 41:52.590
Get out!

846
41:52.590 --> 41:53.110
Out! Out! Out!

847
41:53.110 --> 41:55.710
He looks like a Great Shi merchant,

848
41:56.030 --> 41:57.030
but his features

849
41:57.070 --> 41:58.480
are not those of a southern Han Chinese.

850
41:58.480 --> 41:59.730
We'll check with the Constabulary.

851
41:59.730 --> 42:01.080
Find out his identity.

852
42:15.280 --> 42:16.670
Reports from the border branch say

853
42:16.670 --> 42:17.960
the Crown Prince of Northern Kun

854
42:17.960 --> 42:19.710
has arrived incognito with an envoy party.

855
42:19.710 --> 42:20.670
Calculating the days,

856
42:20.670 --> 42:21.880
this must be them.

857
42:21.510 --> 42:24.440
[Northern Kun's Crown Prince and envoys arrive in disguise, in secret.]

858
42:21.880 --> 42:23.800
Wen is the royal surname of Northern Kun.

859
42:23.800 --> 42:25.630
So this Young Master Wen is…

860
42:24.470 --> 42:25.120
[Border Branch]

861
42:26.460 --> 42:30.280
[Prince of Northern Kun, Wenbu]

862
42:30.440 --> 42:31.440
Young Master Wen.

863
42:31.920 --> 42:33.550
Throw out everyone already staying here.

864
42:33.550 --> 42:34.550
Out of the way!

865
42:35.630 --> 42:36.490
All of you, out!

866
42:36.880 --> 42:38.030
Out! Out! Now!

867
42:38.150 --> 42:38.960
Out!

868
42:39.000 --> 42:40.070
Go! Go! Hurry!

869
42:40.110 --> 42:41.370
Let's go.

870
42:42.800 --> 42:43.710
Young Master Wen.

871
42:43.710 --> 42:44.360
Out! Out! Out!

872
42:44.360 --> 42:45.880
Anyone staying at the Star-Gathering Pavilion

873
42:45.880 --> 42:47.800
is a guest, regardless of status.

874
42:47.830 --> 42:48.580
Upstairs!

875
42:49.190 --> 42:49.980
Hurry up!

876
42:51.940 --> 42:55.570
If you don't leave, you'll be dead.

877
43:00.030 --> 43:00.930
The dead

878
43:01.480 --> 43:03.080
can hardly be called guests.

879
43:04.240 --> 43:05.470
Hurry! Don't dawdle!

880
43:05.500 --> 43:07.750
-I’ll count to three. -Keep up. Hurry!

881
43:08.000 --> 43:09.070
1.

882
43:09.350 --> 43:11.010
Move over there!

883
43:11.670 --> 43:12.480
2.

884
43:17.190 --> 43:18.000
Who dares?

885
43:21.650 --> 43:28.390
[Divine Constable Tally]

886
43:22.230 --> 43:23.360
By the law of the Great Shi,

887
43:23.360 --> 43:25.280
anyone who wields weapons openly

888
43:25.280 --> 43:26.440
and runs rampant in broad daylight

889
43:26.440 --> 43:27.320
shall be flogged 50 times

890
43:27.320 --> 43:28.630
and imprisoned for three months.

891
43:28.630 --> 43:30.830
It's the Divine Constable Bureau seal.

892
43:39.510 --> 43:40.480
Well, well.

893
43:40.710 --> 43:42.070
You're a girl from this inn, aren't you?

894
43:41.810 --> 43:43.100
[Divine Constable Tally]

895
43:43.320 --> 43:45.670
Not bad looking.

896
43:52.070 --> 43:54.150
This is interesting.

897
43:57.320 --> 43:59.150
Your Star-Gathering Pavilion

898
43:59.250 --> 44:01.250
is quite creative.

899
44:01.670 --> 44:03.110
Come on, untie him.

900
44:03.280 --> 44:04.920
Chain yourself to me.

901
44:05.190 --> 44:06.760
Tonight, I am

902
44:06.760 --> 44:08.670
going to have some fun with you.
